{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f35298f80e2f133b","type":"text","text":"[[Sturingaurd.canvas]]\n#NPC #Volstarian_Dynasty ","x":-493,"y":-278,"width":250,"height":55},
		{"id":"fe0249a218d3010f","type":"text","text":"Phaien Volstar is Stus mother\n","x":-493,"y":-160,"width":325,"height":50},
		{"id":"fd89f80c8f9585f9","type":"text","text":"Once maried to Krantho Volstar Phaien was a Stormcrest runaway. She was sworn to marry and bare children for the next heir of the village chief. Phaien was a gentle goliath and hated violence, she never wanted to marry Guldar because he is a brutal man whos lust for blood is unrivaled.\n","x":-515,"y":-80,"width":545,"height":150},
		{"id":"e8a5549f3efbb57f","type":"text","text":"Her kidnapping:\n\nBecause of the curse placed on Kanthro by an arch lich he died in his midlife leaving the throne and safety of the world to his son Ceasar. In the chaos of the collapsing world and battle between the unhielg and Volstar, Guldar took Phien from Volstar and brought her back to storm crest.\n\n\n","x":120,"y":-80,"width":557,"height":200},
		{"id":"6931a20db4235e75","type":"text","text":"Her Legacy:\n\nAlong with a family tie she imprinted fragments of her soul that will awaken overtime within Stu. Showing him families ancient history and their ties to the Storm Lord.\n","x":-487,"y":160,"width":517,"height":160},
		{"id":"93ac35d73a386801","type":"text","text":"Phaiens letter\n\n\nMy Son,\n\nHow I wish I could be alive to tell you this myself but the unfortunate truth is my death has already been initiated and I will be sent to it in 3 days. Know that I do not want to leave you and that I love you more then you will ever know.\n\nYou're father is a terrible man who has raped and murder people for his whims. But please Sturingaurd do not take his life out of anger I forgive him for his awful actions because in the end I got to birth one last beautiful child. You are the child of a Volstar but also the child of a Nordgardan, I know that wont make sense to you right now but it will some day.\n\nOur family stands for justice honor and protecting the weak. If you kill Guldar then you will only become him. I love you and I am sorry for burdening you. Tell Caesar and Achilles that their mother misses them and thought of all three of you in her final moments.\n\n","x":-515,"y":480,"width":722,"height":391},
		{"id":"9ab142c4f38b0673","type":"file","file":"Player Characters/Images/Pasted image 20260915202930.png","x":-501,"y":980,"width":694,"height":911},
		{"id":"ab85ae8588366a72","x":300,"y":480,"width":720,"height":360,"type":"text","text":"Her life in Storm Crest:\n\nAfter being taken from her sons, thought dead by the rest of the world Phaien was forced to marry a man she hated and bare his child. Guldar already had children with another woman but never got over the one that got away. \n\nAfter giving birth to Stu she lived for 5 years in hell raising a baby she loved and protected. As the last descendant of the Nordgardan family she bestowed their will into the heart of this child. The will of Nordgadran can only be passed down to pure blooded goliaths who have a soul that wish for peace and want to protect the world and those they love. After passing down this power her body became weak.\n\nGuldar has no pity for those weak in mind or body and so he threw her to the forest and let nature run its course.\n"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"0dfe8b24299cc8d7","fromNode":"93ac35d73a386801","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"9ab142c4f38b0673","toSide":"top"}
	]
}